msgid "System Updates"
msgstr "Sabunta tsarin"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update"
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update"

msgid "Keep Fluff Linux secure and up to date by installing system updates."
msgstr "Ka shigar da sabuntawar tsarin domin Fluff Linux ya kasance lafiya kuma na zamani."

msgid "System last updated: %1 (%2)"
msgstr "Sabuntawar tsarin ta ƙarshe: %1 (%2)"

msgid "Check for Updates"
msgstr "Duba sabuntawa"

msgid "Install Updates"
msgstr "Shigar da sabuntawa"

msgid "View Updates"
msgstr "Nuna sabuntawa"

msgid "Change view"
msgstr "Canza kallo"

msgid "Updates to Install"
msgstr "Sabuntawar da za a shigar"

msgid "Package details are unavailable."
msgstr "Ba a samun bayanan fakiti."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update is still under development. If you encounter an issue, please report it on our GitHub page."
msgstr "Har yanzu ana haɓaka Fluff Linux Update. Idan ka samu matsala, ka ba da rahoto a shafinmu na GitHub."

msgid "System updates were installed successfully."
msgstr "An shigar da sabuntawar tsarin cikin nasara."

msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

msgid "No network connection!"
msgstr "Babu haɗin hanyar sadarwa!"

msgid "Network connection is limited. If you are not connected to an organizational network, please check your internet connection."
msgstr "Haɗin hanyar sadarwa yana da iyaka. Idan ba ka haɗu da hanyar sadarwar wata ƙungiya ba, duba haɗin intanet ɗinka."

msgid "pacman process is already running."
msgstr "Aikin pacman yana gudana tuni."

msgid "The update process could not be started."
msgstr "Ba a iya fara aikin sabuntawa ba."

msgid "The update process could not be cancelled."
msgstr "Ba a iya soke aikin sabuntawa ba."

msgid "Connection failed while downloading updates. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Haɗin ya gaza yayin sauke sabuntawa. Duba hanyar sadarwa sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "The system update failed."
msgstr "Sabuntawar tsarin ta gaza."

msgid "Downloading updates…"
msgstr "Ana sauke sabuntawa…"

msgid "Installing updates…"
msgstr "Ana shigar da sabuntawa…"

msgid "%1 / %2 downloaded"
msgstr "An sauke %1 / %2"

msgid "%1/%2 updates installed"
msgstr "An shigar da sabuntawa %1/%2"

msgid "Updates are currently being installed. Please avoid powering off or restarting the computer until installation is complete. Interrupting the update may damage system files."
msgstr "Ana shigar da sabuntawa yanzu. Kada ka kashe ko sake kunna kwamfutar har sai an gama shigarwa. Katse sabuntawa na iya lalata fayilolin tsarin."

msgid "The battery is low. Please connect your computer to a charger while installing updates."
msgstr "Batirin ya yi ƙasa. Haɗa kwamfutarka da caja yayin shigar da sabuntawa."

msgid "Update process was cancelled"
msgstr "An soke aikin sabuntawa"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Soke"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "Ana duba sabuntawa…"

msgid "System updates are available"
msgstr "Akwai sabuntawar tsarin"

msgid "Download size: %1"
msgstr "Girman saukewa: %1"

msgid "Storage required for system updates: %1"
msgstr "Wurin ajiya da ake buƙata don sabuntawar tsarin: %1"

msgid "Storage freed after update: %1"
msgstr "Wurin ajiya da zai 'yantu bayan sabuntawa: %1"

msgid "No additional download required"
msgstr "Ba a buƙatar ƙarin saukewa"

msgid "The update checker could not be started. Make sure pacman-contrib is installed."
msgstr "Ba a iya fara mai duba sabuntawa ba. Tabbatar an shigar da pacman-contrib."

msgid "The update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Duban sabuntawa ya tsaya ba zato ba tsammani."

msgid "An unknown error has occurred. Please report this issue on our GitHub page for assistance."
msgstr "An samu kuskuren da ba a sani ba. Ba da rahoton matsalar a shafinmu na GitHub domin samun taimako."

msgid "No internet connection. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Babu haɗin intanet. Duba hanyar sadarwa sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "The repository servers could not be reached. Try again later or check your mirror configuration."
msgstr "Ba a iya isa ga sabobin ma'ajiyar fakiti ba. Sake gwadawa daga baya ko duba saitin sabobin madubi."

msgid "Authorization error, please try again."
msgstr "Kuskuren izini, sake gwadawa."

msgid "The privileged update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Duban sabuntawa da ƙarin iko ya tsaya ba zato ba tsammani."

msgid "The privileged update check could not be started."
msgstr "Ba a iya fara duban sabuntawa da ƙarin iko ba."

msgid "System was not previously updated."
msgstr "Ba a taɓa sabunta tsarin ba."

msgid "The last update information could not be read."
msgstr "Ba a iya karanta bayanan sabuntawar ƙarshe ba."

msgid "The last update information is invalid."
msgstr "Bayanan sabuntawar ƙarshe ba su inganta ba."

msgid "Updates were not installed on this system"
msgstr "Ba a shigar da sabuntawa a wannan tsarin ba"

msgid "To update the system, check for available updates using the button below."
msgstr "Domin sabunta tsarin, duba sabuntawar da ake samu ta maɓallin da ke ƙasa."

msgid "Update date available"
msgstr "Akwai ranar sabuntawa"

msgid "Updated recently"
msgstr "An sabunta kwanan nan"

msgid "System is up to date"
msgstr "Tsarin yana na zamani"

msgid "Last update was installed more than a month ago"
msgstr "An shigar da sabuntawar ƙarshe fiye da wata ɗaya da ya wuce"

msgid "Last update was installed more than three months ago"
msgstr "An shigar da sabuntawar ƙarshe fiye da watanni uku da suka wuce"

msgid "%1 second ago"
msgid_plural "%1 seconds ago"
msgstr[0] "Daƙiƙa %1 da ta wuce"
msgstr[1] "Daƙiƙa %1 da suka wuce"

msgid "%1 minute ago"
msgid_plural "%1 minutes ago"
msgstr[0] "Minti %1 da ya wuce"
msgstr[1] "Minti %1 da suka wuce"

msgid "%1 hour ago"
msgid_plural "%1 hours ago"
msgstr[0] "Awa %1 da ta wuce"
msgstr[1] "Awa %1 da suka wuce"

msgid "%1 day ago"
msgid_plural "%1 days ago"
msgstr[0] "Rana %1 da ta wuce"
msgstr[1] "Kwanaki %1 da suka wuce"

msgid "Action is required"
msgstr "Ana buƙatar mataki"

msgid "Action is required!"
msgstr "Ana buƙatar mataki!"

msgid "Action required"
msgstr "Mataki ya zama dole"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update cannot continue because the upcoming update requires removing “%1”, which is a protected system package. Removing it could prevent Fluff Linux from working correctly. Please report this issue on GitHub for assistance."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update ba zai iya ci gaba ba domin sabuntawar tana buƙatar cire “%1”, fakitin tsarin da aka kare. Cire shi na iya hana Fluff Linux aiki yadda ya kamata. Ba da rahoton matsalar a GitHub domin taimako."

msgid "To allow the system to install updates, Fluff Linux Update needs to remove “%1”. Removing this package may affect related software. If you are not sure, please report the issue on GitHub for help."
msgstr "Domin shigar da sabuntawar tsarin, Fluff Linux Update yana buƙatar cire “%1”. Cire fakitin na iya shafar manhajojin da suka dogara da shi. Idan ba ka da tabbas, ba da rahoton matsalar a GitHub domin taimako."

msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Amince"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Rufe"

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, %1 was automatically removed after it was deemed safe to remove."
msgstr "Domin sabuntawar tsarin ta ci gaba, an cire %1 kai tsaye bayan an tabbatar cire shi yana da aminci."

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, the following packages were automatically removed after they were deemed safe to remove: %1"
msgstr "Domin sabuntawar tsarin ta ci gaba, an cire waɗannan fakiti kai tsaye bayan an tabbatar cire su yana da aminci: %1"

msgid "A file conflict was detected and resolved. %1 was renamed to %2. The update process has restarted."
msgstr "An gano kuma an warware rikicin fayiloli. An sauya sunan %1 zuwa %2. An sake fara aikin sabuntawa."

msgid "The conflicting package could not be removed. Please seek support."
msgstr "Ba a iya cire fakitin da ke rikici ba. Nemi taimako."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update bai iya tabbatar da maɓallin sa hannun ma'ajiyar FluffNet ba. An dakatar da sabuntawa domin kare tsarin."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system. This may indicate a network problem, an unavailable FluffNet server, an expired or rotated signing key, a repository configuration problem, an unexpected key, or a possible repository compromise. Do not manually accept an unexpected key unless Fluff Linux publishes verified instructions."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update bai iya tabbatar da maɓallin sa hannun ma'ajiyar FluffNet ba. An dakatar da sabuntawa domin kare tsarin. Wannan na iya nuna matsalar hanyar sadarwa, sabar FluffNet da ba ta samuwa, maɓallin sa hannu da ya ƙare ko aka sauya, matsalar saitin ma'ajiya, maɓallin da ba a zata ba, ko yiwuwar an kutsa cikin ma'ajiyar. Kada ka amince da maɓallin da ba a zata ba da hannu sai Fluff Linux ya wallafa umarnin da aka tabbatar."

msgid "Repository: %1"
msgstr "Ma'ajiya: %1"

msgid "The official FluffNet repository signing key was verified and added to Pacman."
msgstr "An tabbatar da maɓallin sa hannun ma'ajiyar FluffNet na hukuma kuma an ƙara shi ga Pacman."

msgid "Technical details"
msgstr "Bayanan fasaha"

msgid "Repository signing-key verification technical details"
msgstr "Bayanan fasaha na tabbatar da maɓallin sa hannun ma'ajiya"

msgid "Failure category: %1"
msgstr "Rukunin gazawa: %1"

msgid "Expected fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Alamar maɓallin da ake tsammani: %1"

msgid "Received fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Alamar maɓallin da aka karɓa: %1"

msgid "Requested signing-key fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Alamar maɓallin sa hannun da aka nema: %1"

msgid "Pacman exit status: %1"
msgstr "Matsayin fitowar Pacman: %1"

msgid "FLU version: %1"
msgstr "Sigar FLU: %1"

msgid "Fluff Linux version: %1"
msgstr "Sigar Fluff Linux: %1"

msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Sake gwadawa"

msgid "Copy Technical Details"
msgstr "Kwafi bayanan fasaha"

msgid "Open an Issue on GitHub"
msgstr "Ba da rahoton matsala a GitHub"

msgid "There is not enough free storage to continue the update. Free up space and try again."
msgstr "Babu isasshen wurin ajiya domin ci gaba da sabuntawa. 'Yantar da wuri sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "A package or repository signature could not be verified. The update was stopped. Check your system date and keyring, then try again."
msgstr "Ba a iya tabbatar da sa hannun fakiti ko ma'ajiya ba. An dakatar da sabuntawa. Duba ranar tsarin da kundin maɓallai, sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "The package database is damaged or unreadable. The update was stopped. Please seek support before repairing the database."
msgstr "Rumbun bayanan fakiti ya lalace ko ba a iya karanta shi. An dakatar da sabuntawa. Nemi taimako kafin gyara rumbun bayanan."

msgid "A downloaded package is damaged or incomplete. The update was stopped. Please try again or use a different mirror."
msgstr "Fakitin da aka sauke ya lalace ko bai cika ba. An dakatar da sabuntawa. Sake gwadawa ko amfani da wata sabar madubi."

msgid "The update could not read or write required files. Check filesystem permissions and disk health, then try again."
msgstr "Sabuntawar ba ta iya karanta ko rubuta fayilolin da ake buƙata ba. Duba izinin tsarin fayiloli da lafiyar faifai, sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "The updates could not be downloaded. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Ba a iya sauke sabuntawa ba. Sake gwadawa ko nemi taimako."

msgid "The update transaction could not be prepared. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Ba a iya shirya aikin sabuntawa ba. Sake gwadawa ko nemi taimako."

msgid "The update could not start because sleep prevention could not be enabled. Please try again."
msgstr "Ba a iya fara sabuntawa ba domin ba a iya kunna hana barci ba. Sake gwadawa."

msgid "The package database could not be locked. Close other package managers and check that the filesystem is writable, then try again."
msgstr "Ba a iya kulle rumbun bayanan fakiti ba. Rufe sauran manajojin fakiti, tabbatar ana iya rubutu a tsarin fayiloli sannan ka sake gwadawa."

msgid "Estimated time: %1"
msgstr "Lokacin da aka kiyasta: %1"
